  "system": {
    "slug": "cerberus-research-scientist",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 4
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Cerberus Research Scientists are recruited from the best universities and corporate research programs, drawn by funding, resources, and the Illusive Man's vision of human advancement. They conduct cutting-edge research in genetics, cybernetics, biotics, and alien technology. They are non-combatants but may be valuable hostages or sources of intelligence. They carry a light pistol for self-defense and wear standard-issue Cerberus kinetic shields.</p><p><strong>Valuable Intelligence:</strong> A captured Cerberus Scientist who succeeds on a Deception check (DC 18) against the captor's Perception can deceive them about research details. On a failure, they provide genuine intelligence about current Cerberus projects.</p>",
